  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=293",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『美的』两用双温冰箱</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/0472d3a2aee24891ad01ebebf31faa6c.png?auth_key=1795677429-c809768df87d4af9b686247edb1ef5c3-0-ca3fe472428b08bfd62cc5fd18c8c4e76f696a98565d0fc4fdaf9df8c8c90115\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 435.12px;height: 718.25px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 美的两用双温冰箱</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">美的两用双温冰箱，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”，用户通过车机大屏，操控冰箱冷冻启停、调温、模式切换功能。同时为用户提供各类场景自动化功能，用户在“智慧物联APP”场景中配置冰箱联动。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5f96352b4bed4ca4984ac1116e2a4f42.png?auth_key=1795677429-4288a831f10646739cdcac620661a648-0-9ad11ecb7aeda2032d43782ba351b2225265293631b3826cd5d5d14db643391d\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 461.12px;height: 761.17px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 车机操控冰箱</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. &nbsp;车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏控制冰箱的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">冰箱</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">冷冻启停</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">温度显示、调节（</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">-20℃～20℃</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">）；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">强劲制冷/节能制冷模式切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">温标切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">电源低压保护选择；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/cbac0a1064844f5e98befa13bb9458dd.png?auth_key=1795677429-8f4100929b89401db75f3a3d820b9337-0-ffb683b0784e9558a9e6e8f04181dce5bb781c96ba00b576a9d3f447d761c57a\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 778.12px;height: 437.68px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 车机大屏操控</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. &nbsp;场景自动化功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">用户在</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">“智慧物联APP”场景中，可以根据需要配置冰箱联动。</span></p>"
}
